Third-party components
----------------------

This project is built on, and the compiled SD image redistributes, the
following upstream projects. Their licenses apply to their respective
portions. Full per-component license texts are in `licenses/`. Each release
tarball ships this NOTICE, the LICENSE, the `licenses/` texts, and a
`SOURCES.txt` with the corresponding source locations and a written offer.

* yi-hack-Allwinner-v2  -- https://github.com/roleoroleo/yi-hack-Allwinner-v2
  The tooling, scripts and helper binaries (ipc_cmd, ipc_multiplex.so,
  imggrabber, set_tz_offset, dropbearmulti, and alsa-lib patched for audio-FIFO
  support) are built from this tree at build time. Mixed licensing: the repo
  `LICENSE` file is MIT, but several components are GPL-3.0 (notably ipc_cmd /
  libipc and imggrabber) -- see that project. `set_tz_offset` ships no license
  header in its source. The vendored `unifi/script/ethdhcp.sh` and
  `wifidhcp.sh` are derivatives of this tree; they remain GPL-3.0-or-later and
  are combined into this AGPL-3.0-or-later work under GPLv3 section 13 /
  AGPLv3 section 13.

* libipc -- https://github.com/TheCrypt0/libipc
  Upstream library that yi-hack's `ipc_cmd` and `ipc_multiplex.so` derive from.
  GPL-3.0.

* roleo's rRTSPServer -- https://github.com/roleoroleo/yi-hack-Allwinner
  The fshare shared-memory framing and the original video-push path were
  reverse engineered with reference to this GPLv3 project. `unifi_flv_bridge`
  is now an independent implementation (work/flv_bridge); neither rRTSPServer
  nor LIVE555 is compiled into it any more.

* FAAD2 -- https://github.com/knik0/faad2
  AAC decoder used by unifi_flv_bridge (AAC -> Opus transcode) and talkback_rx
  (ADTS mobile talkback). Copyright (C) 2003-2005 M. Bakker, Nero AG.
  GPL-2.0-or-later, compatible with this project's AGPL-3.0. Fetched and built
  from source at build time; not redistributed in this repository.

* libopus -- https://opus-codec.org/
  Used by talkback_rx for RTP/Opus decode and by unifi_flv_bridge to encode the
  transcoded FLV type-10 audio track. Copyright Xiph.Org. BSD-2-Clause.

* gorilla/websocket -- https://github.com/gorilla/websocket
  WebSocket transport for the Go avclient. Copyright (c) 2013 The Gorilla
  WebSocket Authors. BSD-2-Clause.

* alsa-lib -- https://www.alsa-project.org/
  The patched `libasound.so.2` is derived from alsa-lib 1.1.4.1 (LGPL-2.1)
  with the yi-hack audio-FIFO patch applied.

* FFmpeg -- https://ffmpeg.org/
  Statically linked into the distributed `imggrabber` (still capture) by
  yi-hack's snapshot module. LGPL-2.1.

* libjpeg-turbo -- https://github.com/libjpeg-turbo/libjpeg-turbo
  Statically linked into the distributed `imggrabber` for JPEG encoding.
  BSD-3-Clause / IJG.

* unifi-cam-proxy -- https://github.com/keshavdv/unifi-cam-proxy
  Protocol/message-shape reference for the Go avclient. Copyright (c) 2023
  Keshav Varma. MIT.

* Dropbear SSH -- https://matt.ucc.asn.au/dropbear/dropbear.html
  MIT-style license.


